9. Reverse List
nums = [1,2,3,4,5]
rev = []

for i in nums:
    rev = [i] + rev

print(rev)

10. Second Largest Element
nums = [10,20,30,40]
nums.sort()
print(nums[-2])

Python Dictionaries

1. Student Dictionary
student = {"name":"Aditya","age":18,"city":"Mumbai"}
print(student)

2. Print Keys

d = {"a":1,"b":2}
print(d.keys())

3. Print Values
d = {"a":1,"b":2}
